WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.650
- Sanctions have finally
come for the Kraken,

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:05.540
and man, these ones are a doozy.

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:07.620
We've covered the case
of King versus Whitmer

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:08.930
in Michigan many times.

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:10.500
Last we left it, the city of Detroit

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.960
and the state of Michigan
were going after Sidney Powell

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.580
and her team Kraken wranglers

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:17.300
for sanctions for the cost of
going through the litigation

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.290
that was manifestly ridiculous.

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:22.400
Well, Judge Parker has
come down like a hammer

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.340
on Sidney Powell and her entire team.

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:27.670
They are going to have to pay
for the costs of litigation.

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:29.010
It's joint in several liability

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:31.230
against all of Sydney Powell's lawyers,

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:34.010
which means that the defendants
can get the entire amount

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:35.810
from any single one of the defendants

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:36.960
and it will be up to the defendants

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:40.340
to sue each other for only
their portion of the liability.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.230
That's going to be fun to watch.

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:44.120
But the coup de grace
comes on the very last page

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.950
of this decision where
the judge basically refers

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:48.480
every single one of those attorneys

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:50.380
to the various states'
disciplinary committees,

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:53.440
basically hinting that she
wants all of them disbarred.

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:56.560
No lawyer ever wants to find
themselves in that situation.

00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:57.393
So in the future,

00:00:57.393 --> 00:01:00.253
we may never see any of
those people in court.

